DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261114T210000
DTSTAMP:20261112T065329Z
UID:funcheap-20261114-citygurlzgrouphikediscov
CATEGORIES:concert,free
DESCRIPTION:https://sf.funcheap.com/city-gurlz-group-hike-discover-glen-ca
 nyon-parks-hidden-rock-formations/\nLocation: san francisco\nPrice: Free\n
 Categories: concert\, free\nSource: funcheap/san-francisco\n\nCity Gurlz H
 ike hosts its final hike of the season at Glen Canyon Park\, meeting at Gl
 en Park Rec Center. The urban canyon features rock formations and Islais C
 reek\, one of San Francisco’s few remaining free-flowing creeks. Attende
 es are asked to bring water\, a snack\, and old hiking shoes or sneakers f
 or muddy conditions\; RSVP is requested Original Event Description: our la
 st city gurlz hike of the season 🥾✨ join us for our last hike of the 
 season before we go into winter hibernation at glen canyon park next satur
 day\, november 14! this large urban canyon has beautiful rock formations\,
  and is home to islais creek\, one of the few remaining free-flowing creek
 s in san francisco. and it’s totally public transit accessible! 🚌 thi
 ngs to bring: 💦 water 🥾 old hiking shoes or sneakers (it will be mud
 dy!) 🍎 a snack for energy 💓 good vibes only meeting point: 📍glen 
 park rec center rsvp 🔗 in the bio_ @citygurlzhike City Gurlz Hike 🥾 
 a space for Black & brown city gurlz to play & connect through nature in s
 f 🦋 founder @thedaisyprado next event: november 14 💌 daisyprado.m@gm
 ail.com citygurlzhike.com
LOCATION:san francisco
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/city-gurlz-group-hike-discover-glen-canyon-par
 ks-hidden-rock-formations/
